          Let's try and preserve them for the next visitors eager to wonder at the extraordinary diversity of wildlife of Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You will find some endemic species in the gardens at Riverside Cottages. We have created a nature trail where you will see the White Backed Palm amongst other rare plants. There are also sound recordings of the jungle sounds that you will hear as you follow <a href="/riverside-cottages-nature-trail/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">the trail </a> in our grounds. For insights into <a href="/fungal-in-the-jungle-the-hidden-mushrooms-of-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok fungi</a> visit our blog.
        </p>
